    "event_type": "hidden_action",
    "truth_description": "Ruth returns home and goes to her garden. She cuts the foxglove stems she has been preparing for three days and extracts the glycoside into a small vial on her kitchen range. She has read about cardiac glycosides in an old pharmacy text — she knows the right amount.",
